      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRAVITY MONELLI (2) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 3 lengths at this track in a handy 37.37 beating SNAPPY SNACKER. Boasts a strong record from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from four starts. Looks to have an edge on most of these. SNAPPY SNACKER (1) was big odds last time but gave a huge sight after a fast early split, grabbed late but holding on to a placing when a 3 length second (37.57) over 652m at this track. Has never missed the frame from eight starts from this draw, including three wins. Expecting another good run. JUST A BINDI (8) collided with another runner and was out of the placings when a 8 length fourth (35.13) in a Grade 4/5 at Cannington. Gets chance to atone. FERNDALE FLYER (6) should be thereabouts.",
